---
// The run as a loop: the operator enters intent while the work is moving.
---

<figure class="loop" data-loop aria-labelledby="loop-title">
  <div class="loop__stage">
    <span class="loop__ring" data-loop-ring aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="loop__center">The run</span>
    <span class="loop__node loop__node--intent" data-loop-node>Intent enters</span>
    <span class="loop__node loop__node--claim" data-loop-node>Work is claimed</span>
    <span class="loop__node loop__node--result" data-loop-node>Result is written</span>
    <span class="loop__node loop__node--read" data-loop-node>Operator reads</span>
    <span class="loop__operator">Operator</span>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="loop-title">
    The operator can enter intent at any point in the run. What the machine does is the sum of
    those entries.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .loop {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 24px 26px 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--bg-2);
  }

  .loop__stage {
    position: relative;
    height: 280px;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .loop__ring {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    width: 220px;
    height: 220px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--line-2);
    border-radius: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }

  .loop__center {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .loop__node {
    position: absolute;
    padding: 7px 11px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--bg-2);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    font-size: 12px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .loop__node--intent {
    left: 50%;
    top: 0;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .loop__node--claim {
    left: calc(50% + 130px);
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .loop__node--result {
    left: 50%;
    bottom: 0;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .loop__node--read {
    right: calc(50% + 130px);
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .loop__operator {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    padding: 7px 11px;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 12px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .loop figcaption {
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--fg-3);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .loop {
      padding: 20px 18px 18px;
    }

    .loop__stage {
      height: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .loop__ring,
    .loop__center,
    .loop__operator {
      display: none;
    }

    .loop__node {
      position: static;
      transform: none;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
